WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.175
The heart of the configuration
is one reviewed file.

2
00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:07.786
It names the scopes, the roles, who's
eligible, and the settings for each tier,

3
00:00:07.786 --> 00:00:11.037
taken from the workbook's
privileged-access design:

4
00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:15.724
shorter activations and tighter
eligibility for the most sensitive tier,

5
00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:20.562
approval by a named group, and a
justification and ticket on every activation.

6
00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:23.312
Those values are the
program's design guidance.

7
00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:27.162
The loader also refuses what
Learn or the program rules out.

8
00:00:27.162 --> 00:00:29.762
The subtle one is authentication context:

9
00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:34.515
Learn says to create its Conditional
Access policy before you point PIM at it,

10
00:00:34.515 --> 00:00:37.320
so the file can't use it
until that's confirmed.
